WEBVTT

00:03:56.899 --> 00:04:00.278
(Music)

00:04:09.745 --> 00:04:13.582
(Applause)

00:04:13.582 --> 00:04:15.626
So at first this felt
really, really silly.

00:04:15.626 --> 00:04:18.462
I mean, what did dancing
have to do with climate action?

00:04:18.587 --> 00:04:23.092
And what good was sharing good news
when everything felt so bad?

00:04:23.801 --> 00:04:25.970
But then I began to receive
people's feedback.

00:04:26.512 --> 00:04:27.513
People told me

00:04:27.513 --> 00:04:30.725
that these videos really helped
mitigate their climate anxiety,